      "message": "Fixed in PS6: compose now sets the To and Cc headers only when the qualified address list is non-empty, so cc\u003d[] no longer emits an empty Cc header and smtplib derives no envelope recipient from it. Verified against a local SMTP sink: the clean envelope is mail from:\u003cquads@example.com\u003e / rcpt to:\u003cdwilson@example.com\u003e / data, with no rcpt to:\u003c\u003e. Added test_email_plugin_empty_cc_omits_header (also covering recipients\u003d[]) asserting no empty To/Cc header.",
